OL,3,GNEWSADad 'at peace' after 100-mile run
OL,4,Ain memory of son
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dad whose son died from meningitis B
OL,7,F(MenB) says he finally feels "at peace"
OL,8,Fafter helping to cement his legacy.
OL,10,FAnthony Mills, from Kidderminster,
OL,11,FWorcestershire, was forced to say
OL,12,Fgoodbye to his 18-year-old son Aaron in
OL,13,FJanuary after his condition suddenly
OL,14,Fdeteriorated.
OL,16,FOn Sunday, family friend Shaun McEntee
OL,17,Fcompleted a run of more than 100 miles
OL,18,Ffrom Kidderminster Harriers' Aggborough
OL,19,FStadium to Liverpool FC's Anfield
OL,20,FStadium to raise awareness of the
OL,21,Fillness.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
