OL,3,GNEWSADad 'at peace' after 100-mile run
OL,4,Ain memory of son
OL,5,
OL,6,FMills, who spoke to students about MenB
OL,7,Fat universities along McEntee's route,
OL,8,Fsaid: "The whole experience was just
OL,9,Famazing. I feel a bit guilty because I
OL,10,Fenjoyed every single minute of it."
